{"id":"vod_lz_48108","vodId":"48108","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"命运之夜","name_cn":"命运之夜","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230122-1/5d3e36b815d9b7acce23142c22e44e45.jpg"},"summary":"十年前，几乎毁灭世界的大灾难中，卫宫士郎被魔术师卫宫切嗣所救，成为其养子。　　十年后，士郎为履行与已故的养父之间的约定——成为“正义的伙伴”，而每日不停的进行魔术锻炼。　　偶然的一天，士郎被卷入了称为“圣杯战争”的魔术师之间的对决。规则是一位魔术师与一位“英灵”结成契约。所谓“圣杯战争”，胜利者可以获得圣杯来实现任何愿望。于是，七位魔术师与七位“英灵”一起加入了这个为了创造奇迹的厮杀之中。　　卫宫士郎深知，十年前的那场大灾难就是“圣杯战争”引起的，为了避免悲剧再次发生，他与自己的“英灵”Sabar一起，投身于这充满危险与艰辛的”圣杯战争”之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-06-04 12:19:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6906_42b22b32/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6909_78651529/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6908_47769adb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6910_270b8c37/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6911_1ff46690/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6913_5b232e16/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6912_d1921692/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6914_7004ed11/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6915_45511c95/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6916_cd49aff1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6917_57472ee5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250604/31604_055513f2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6919_e70bc0d5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230120/6921_bdb8f13a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn